bran\u00e7a de participa\u00e7\u00e3o a todos os finalistas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar o regulamento oficial e percursos?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O regulamento oficial detalhado e informa\u00e7\u00f5es de percurso podem ser consultados atrav\u00e9s da liga\u00e7\u00e3o oficial de regulamento indicada nesta p\u00e1gina.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Stut Santo Thyrso Ultra Trilhos 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-13\", \"endDate\": \"2027-02-13\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Santo Tirso, Porto\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Santo Tirso\", \"addressRegion\": \"Porto\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"Stut Santo Thyrso Ultra Trilhos 2027 realiza-se a 13 de Fevereiro em Santo Tirso. Trilhos de 45 km, 32 km, 17 km, 12 km e caminhada. Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es abertas!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-stut-santo-thyrso-ultra-trilhos.webp\"], \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/stopandgo.net\/events\/stut-santo-thyrso-ultra-trilhos-2027\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEnti